# Use a REST client or Swagger. Replace only the private key placeholder locally.
@api = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@gateway = http://127.0.0.1:4000
@gateway_key = replace-with-your-private-LITELLM_MASTER_KEY

### Registered routes (requires the gateway key)
GET {{gateway}}/v1/models
Authorization: Bearer {{gateway_key}}

### Local chat with provider-error fallback to the configured OpenAI route
POST {{gateway}}/v1/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{gateway_key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"model":"nexa-chat","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Say hello in one sentence."}],"max_tokens":80}

### Explicit OpenAI chat comparison
POST {{gateway}}/v1/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{gateway_key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"model":"nexa-chat-openai","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Say hello in one sentence."}],"max_tokens":80}

### Local Qwen embedding: expected 1024 dimensions; verify your runtime
POST {{gateway}}/v1/embeddings
Authorization: Bearer {{gateway_key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"model":"nexa-embed-local","input":["Maximum NexaHome loan amount"]}

### OpenAI embedding: 1536 dimensions, a separate index/profile
POST {{gateway}}/v1/embeddings
Authorization: Bearer {{gateway_key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"model":"nexa-embed-openai","input":["Maximum NexaHome loan amount"]}

### Application request: repeat unchanged with the cache config enabled
# Inspect provenance.observed_chat_model and provenance.gateway_cache_hit.
POST {{api}}/answer
Content-Type: application/json

{"query":"What is the maximum loan amount for a NexaHome Loan?","as_of":"2026-10-01","product_id":"NEXA-HL","top_k":5}
